From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 21:30:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wayland: drop the primary selection

Middle-click paste pastes whatever was last selected, which is easy to
trigger by accident and leaks text between apps. Stop advertising
zwp_primary_selection_device_manager_v1 and ignore the primary selection
in ext_data_control so no client can set or read it.

Upstream-Status: luft-only Kestrel has no middle-click paste
---
 src/meson.build                               |   7 -
 src/wayland/meta-wayland-data-control.c       |  30 +-
 .../meta-wayland-data-device-primary.c        | 371 ------------------
 .../meta-wayland-data-device-primary.h        |  56 ---
 src/wayland/meta-wayland-data-offer-primary.c | 145 -------
 src/wayland/meta-wayland-data-offer-primary.h |  29 --
 .../meta-wayland-data-source-primary.c        | 117 ------
 .../meta-wayland-data-source-primary.h        |  34 --
 src/wayland/meta-wayland-seat.c               |   3 -
 src/wayland/meta-wayland-seat.h               |   2 -
 src/wayland/meta-wayland-versions.h           |   1 -
 src/wayland/meta-wayland.c                    |   1 -
 12 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 789 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 src/wayland/meta-wayland-data-device-primary.c
 delete mode 100644 src/wayland/meta-wayland-data-device-primary.h
 delete mode 100644 src/wayland/meta-wayland-data-offer-primary.c
 delete mode 100644 src/wayland/meta-wayland-data-offer-primary.h
 delete mode 100644 src/wayland/meta-wayland-data-source-primary.c
 delete mode 100644 src/wayland/meta-wayland-data-source-primary.h

